                                                "sense_id": "5c616240-77f7-3b83-99f3-00a39097915f",
                                                "text": "On a recent trip down the Rhine many of the trains we saw were still steam-hauled, presumably through an insufficiency of electric locomotives, as yet, to deal with peak summer traffic."
